WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
If you're on a split-dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.440
Confirm with your written instructions. Split dosing means you take the first

3
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.360
half of your prep the

4
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.640
evening before and the second half the morning of your procedure, typically six

5
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.320
hours before your

6
00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.790
arrival time. When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose as

7
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.000
directed on your prep

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.690
instructions. Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff

9
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.480
time we've specified.

10
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.980
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That's how we know

11
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.040
your prep is working.

12
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:35.590
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first

13
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:36.480
thing in the morning.

14
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.760
You're almost done.
